{"1":{"w":[{"c":"يسٓ","d":"ya-seen","e":"Ya Sin"}],"a":{"g":"Ya, Seen."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْقُرْءَانِ","d":"wal-qur'āni","e":"By the Quran"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمِ","d":"l-ḥakīmi","e":"the Wise"}],"a":{"g":"By the wise Qur'an."}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّكَ","d":"innaka","e":"Indeed you"},{"c":"لَمِنَ","d":"lamina","e":"(are) among"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلِينَ","d":"l-mur'salīna","e":"the Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed you, [O Muhammad], are from among the messengers,"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"On"},{"c":"صِرَاطٍ","d":"ṣirāṭin","e":"a Path"},{"c":"مُسْتَقِيمٍ","d":"mus'taqīmin","e":"straight"}],"a":{"g":"On a straight path."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"تَنْزِيلَ","d":"tanzīla","e":"A revelation"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزِ","d":"l-ʿazīzi","e":"(of) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الرَّحِيمِ","d":"l-raḥīmi","e":"the Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"[This is] a revelation of the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"لِتُنْذِرَ","d":"litundhira","e":"That you may warn"},{"c":"قَوْمًا","d":"qawman","e":"a people"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"not"},{"c":"أُنْذِرَ","d":"undhira","e":"were warned"},{"c":"ءَابَاؤُهُمْ","d":"ābāuhum","e":"their forefathers"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"غَافِلُونَ","d":"ghāfilūna","e":"(are) heedless"}],"a":{"g":"That you may warn a people whose forefathers were not warned, so they are unaware."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"لَقَدْ","d":"laqad","e":"Certainly"},{"c":"حَقَّ","d":"ḥaqqa","e":"(has) proved true"},{"c":"الْقَوْلُ","d":"l-qawlu","e":"the word"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"أَكْثَرِهِمْ","d":"aktharihim","e":"most of them"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"believe"}],"a":{"g":"Already the word has come into effect upon most of them, so they do not believe."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"جَعَلْنَا","d":"jaʿalnā","e":"[We] have placed"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"on"},{"c":"أَعْنَاقِهِمْ","d":"aʿnāqihim","e":"their necks"},{"c":"أَغْلَالًا","d":"aghlālan","e":"iron collars"},{"c":"فَهِيَ","d":"fahiya","e":"and they"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"(are up) to"},{"c":"الْأَذْقَانِ","d":"l-adhqāni","e":"the chins"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"مُقْمَحُونَ","d":"muq'maḥūna","e":"(are with) heads aloft"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We have put shackles on their necks, and they are to their chins, so they are with heads [kept] aloft."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَعَلْنَا","d":"wajaʿalnā","e":"And We have made"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"before them"},{"c":"بَيْنِ","d":"bayni","e":"before them"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"before them"},{"c":"سَدًّا","d":"saddan","e":"a barrier"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"and behind them"},{"c":"خَلْفِهِمْ","d":"khalfihim","e":"and behind them"},{"c":"سَدًّا","d":"saddan","e":"a barrier"},{"c":"فَأَغْشَيْنَاهُمْ","d":"fa-aghshaynāhum","e":"and We covered them"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"so they"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يُبْصِرُونَ","d":"yub'ṣirūna","e":"see"}],"a":{"g":"And We have put before them a barrier and behind them a barrier and covered them, so they do not see."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَسَوَاءٌ","d":"wasawāon","e":"And it (is) same"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"to them"},{"c":"ءَأَنْذَرْتَهُمْ","d":"a-andhartahum","e":"whether you warn them"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"تُنْذِرْهُمْ","d":"tundhir'hum","e":"warn them"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"yu'minūna","e":"they will believe"}],"a":{"g":"And it is all the same for them whether you warn them or do not warn them - they will not believe."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"تُنْذِرُ","d":"tundhiru","e":"you (can) warn"},{"c":"مَنِ","d":"mani","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"اتَّبَعَ","d":"ittabaʿa","e":"follows"},{"c":"الذِّكْرَ","d":"l-dhik'ra","e":"the Reminder"},{"c":"وَخَشِيَ","d":"wakhashiya","e":"and fears"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنَ","d":"l-raḥmāna","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"بِالْغَيْبِ","d":"bil-ghaybi","e":"in the unseen"},{"c":"فَبَشِّرْهُ","d":"fabashir'hu","e":"So give him glad tidings"},{"c":"بِمَغْفِرَةٍ","d":"bimaghfiratin","e":"of forgiveness"},{"c":"وَأَجْرٍ","d":"wa-ajrin","e":"and a reward"},{"c":"كَرِيمٍ","d":"karīmin","e":"noble"}],"a":{"g":"You can only warn one who follows the message and fears the Most Merciful unseen. So give him good tidings of forgiveness and noble reward."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"نُحْيِي","d":"nuḥ'yī","e":"give life"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَى","d":"l-mawtā","e":"(to) the dead"},{"c":"وَنَكْتُبُ","d":"wanaktubu","e":"and We record"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"قَدَّمُوا","d":"qaddamū","e":"they have sent before"},{"c":"وَءَاثَارَهُمْ","d":"waāthārahum","e":"and their footprints"},{"c":"وَكُلَّ","d":"wakulla","e":"and every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"أَحْصَيْنَاهُ","d":"aḥṣaynāhu","e":"We have enumerated it"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"إِمَامٍ","d":"imāmin","e":"a Register"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, it is We who bring the dead to life and record what they have put forth and what they left behind, and all things We have enumerated in a clear register."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَاضْرِبْ","d":"wa-iḍ'rib","e":"And set forth"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"مَثَلًا","d":"mathalan","e":"an example"},{"c":"أَصْحَابَ","d":"aṣḥāba","e":"(of the) companions"},{"c":"الْقَرْيَةِ","d":"l-qaryati","e":"(of) the city"},{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"when"},{"c":"جَاءَهَا","d":"jāahā","e":"came to it"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلُونَ","d":"l-mur'salūna","e":"the Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"And present to them an example: the people of the city, when the messengers came to it -"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"إِذْ","d":"idh","e":"When"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"We sent"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِمُ","d":"ilayhimu","e":"to them"},{"c":"اثْنَيْنِ","d":"ith'nayni","e":"two (Messengers)"},{"c":"فَكَذَّبُوهُمَا","d":"fakadhabūhumā","e":"but they denied both of them"},{"c":"فَعَزَّزْنَا","d":"faʿazzaznā","e":"so We strengthened them"},{"c":"بِثَالِثٍ","d":"bithālithin","e":"with a third"},{"c":"فَقَالُوا","d":"faqālū","e":"and they said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"إِلَيْكُمْ","d":"ilaykum","e":"to you"},{"c":"مُرْسَلُونَ","d":"mur'salūna","e":"(are) Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"When We sent to them two but they denied them, so We strengthened them with a third, and they said, \"Indeed, we are messengers to you.\""}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"(are) but"},{"c":"بَشَرٌ","d":"basharun","e":"human beings"},{"c":"مِثْلُنَا","d":"mith'lunā","e":"like us"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"أَنْزَلَ","d":"anzala","e":"has revealed"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنُ","d":"l-raḥmānu","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"(are) but"},{"c":"تَكْذِبُونَ","d":"takdhibūna","e":"lying"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"You are not but human beings like us, and the Most Merciful has not revealed a thing. You are only telling lies.\""}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"رَبُّنَا","d":"rabbunā","e":"Our Lord"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُ","d":"yaʿlamu","e":"knows"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"that we"},{"c":"إِلَيْكُمْ","d":"ilaykum","e":"to you"},{"c":"لَمُرْسَلُونَ","d":"lamur'salūna","e":"(are) surely Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Our Lord knows that we are messengers to you,"}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"(is) on us"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الْبَلَاغُ","d":"l-balāghu","e":"the conveyance"},{"c":"الْمُبِينُ","d":"l-mubīnu","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And we are not responsible except for clear notification.\""}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"تَطَيَّرْنَا","d":"taṭayyarnā","e":"[we] see an evil omen"},{"c":"بِكُمْ","d":"bikum","e":"from you"},{"c":"لَئِنْ","d":"la-in","e":"If"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"تَنْتَهُوا","d":"tantahū","e":"you desist"},{"c":"لَنَرْجُمَنَّكُمْ","d":"lanarjumannakum","e":"surely we will stone you"},{"c":"وَلَيَمَسَّنَّكُمْ","d":"walayamassannakum","e":"and surely will touch you"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"from us"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمٌ","d":"alīmun","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Indeed, we consider you a bad omen. If you do not desist, we will surely stone you, and there will surely touch you, from us, a painful punishment.\""}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They said"},{"c":"طَائِرُكُمْ","d":"ṭāirukum","e":"Your evil omen"},{"c":"مَعَكُمْ","d":"maʿakum","e":"(be) with you!"},{"c":"أَئِنْ","d":"a-in","e":"Is it because"},{"c":"ذُكِّرْتُمْ","d":"dhukkir'tum","e":"you are admonished"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"you"},{"c":"قَوْمٌ","d":"qawmun","e":"(are) a people"},{"c":"مُسْرِفُونَ","d":"mus'rifūna","e":"transgressing"}],"a":{"g":"They said, \"Your omen is with yourselves. Is it because you were reminded? Rather, you are a transgressing people.\""}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَاءَ","d":"wajāa","e":"And came"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"أَقْصَا","d":"aqṣā","e":"(the) farthest end"},{"c":"الْمَدِينَةِ","d":"l-madīnati","e":"(of) the city"},{"c":"رَجُلٌ","d":"rajulun","e":"a man"},{"c":"يَسْعَى","d":"yasʿā","e":"running"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"يَاقَوْمِ","d":"yāqawmi","e":"O my People!"},{"c":"اتَّبِعُوا","d":"ittabiʿū","e":"Follow"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلِينَ","d":"l-mur'salīna","e":"the Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"And there came from the farthest end of the city a man, running. He said, \"O my people, follow the messengers."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"اتَّبِعُوا","d":"ittabiʿū","e":"Follow"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(those) who"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"يَسْءَلُكُمْ","d":"yasalukum","e":"ask (of) you"},{"c":"أَجْرًا","d":"ajran","e":"any payment"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"and they"},{"c":"مُهْتَدُونَ","d":"muh'tadūna","e":"(are) rightly guided"}],"a":{"g":"Follow those who do not ask of you [any] payment, and they are [rightly] guided."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"لِيَ","d":"liya","e":"(is) for me"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(that) not"},{"c":"أَعْبُدُ","d":"aʿbudu","e":"I worship"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"the One Who"},{"c":"فَطَرَنِي","d":"faṭaranī","e":"created me"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْهِ","d":"wa-ilayhi","e":"and to Whom"},{"c":"تُرْجَعُونَ","d":"tur'jaʿūna","e":"you will be returned"}],"a":{"g":"And why should I not worship He who created me and to whom you will be returned?"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"ءَأَتَّخِذُ","d":"a-attakhidhu","e":"Should I take"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"besides Him"},{"c":"دُونِهِ","d":"dūnihi","e":"besides Him"},{"c":"ءَالِهَةً","d":"ālihatan","e":"gods"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"If"},{"c":"يُرِدْنِ","d":"yurid'ni","e":"intends for me"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنُ","d":"l-raḥmānu","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"بِضُرٍّ","d":"biḍurrin","e":"any harm"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تُغْنِ","d":"tugh'ni","e":"will avail"},{"c":"عَنِّي","d":"ʿannī","e":"[from] me"},{"c":"شَفَاعَتُهُمْ","d":"shafāʿatuhum","e":"their intercession"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"(in) anything"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يُنْقِذُونِ","d":"yunqidhūni","e":"they (can) save me"}],"a":{"g":"Should I take other than Him [false] deities [while], if the Most Merciful intends for me some adversity, their intercession will not avail me at all, nor can they save me?"}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"إِذًا","d":"idhan","e":"then"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"surely would be in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"an error"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, I would then be in manifest error."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"ءَامَنْتُ","d":"āmantu","e":"have believed"},{"c":"بِرَبِّكُمْ","d":"birabbikum","e":"in your Lord"},{"c":"فَاسْمَعُونِ","d":"fa-is'maʿūni","e":"so listen to me"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, I have believed in your Lord, so listen to me.\""}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"قِيلَ","d":"qīla","e":"It was said"},{"c":"ادْخُلِ","d":"ud'khuli","e":"Enter"},{"c":"الْجَنَّةَ","d":"l-janata","e":"Paradise"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He said"},{"c":"يَالَيْتَ","d":"yālayta","e":"O would that!"},{"c":"قَوْمِي","d":"qawmī","e":"My people"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"knew"}],"a":{"g":"It was said, \"Enter Paradise.\" He said, \"I wish my people could know"}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"Of how"},{"c":"غَفَرَ","d":"ghafara","e":"has forgiven"},{"c":"لِي","d":"lī","e":"me"},{"c":"رَبِّي","d":"rabbī","e":"my Lord"},{"c":"وَجَعَلَنِي","d":"wajaʿalanī","e":"and placed me"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"among"},{"c":"الْمُكْرَمِينَ","d":"l-muk'ramīna","e":"the honored ones"}],"a":{"g":"Of how my Lord has forgiven me and placed me among the honored.\""}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَنْزَلْنَا","d":"anzalnā","e":"We sent down"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"قَوْمِهِ","d":"qawmihi","e":"his people"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"after him"},{"c":"بَعْدِهِ","d":"baʿdihi","e":"after him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"جُنْدٍ","d":"jundin","e":"host"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"كُنَّا","d":"kunnā","e":"were We"},{"c":"مُنْزِلِينَ","d":"munzilīna","e":"(to) send down"}],"a":{"g":"And We did not send down upon his people after him any soldiers from the heaven, nor would We have done so."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"كَانَتْ","d":"kānat","e":"it was"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"صَيْحَةً","d":"ṣayḥatan","e":"a shout"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةً","d":"wāḥidatan","e":"one"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"then behold!"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"خَامِدُونَ","d":"khāmidūna","e":"(were) extinguished"}],"a":{"g":"It was not but one shout, and immediately they were extinguished."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"يَاحَسْرَةً","d":"yāḥasratan","e":"Alas"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"for"},{"c":"الْعِبَادِ","d":"l-ʿibādi","e":"the servants"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَأْتِيهِمْ","d":"yatīhim","e":"came to them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"رَسُولٍ","d":"rasūlin","e":"Messenger"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they did"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"mock at him"},{"c":"يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ","d":"yastahziūna","e":"mock at him"}],"a":{"g":"How regretful for the servants. There did not come to them any messenger except that they used to ridicule him."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they see"},{"c":"كَمْ","d":"kam","e":"how many"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْنَا","d":"ahlaknā","e":"We destroyed"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُمْ","d":"qablahum","e":"before them"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْقُرُونِ","d":"l-qurūni","e":"the generations"},{"c":"أَنَّهُمْ","d":"annahum","e":"That they"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِمْ","d":"ilayhim","e":"to them"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"will not return"},{"c":"يَرْجِعُونَ","d":"yarjiʿūna","e":"will not return"}],"a":{"g":"Have they not considered how many generations We destroyed before them - that they to them will not return?"}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And surely"},{"c":"كُلٌّ","d":"kullun","e":"all"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"then"},{"c":"جَمِيعٌ","d":"jamīʿun","e":"together"},{"c":"لَدَيْنَا","d":"ladaynā","e":"before Us"},{"c":"مُحْضَرُونَ","d":"muḥ'ḍarūna","e":"(will be) brought"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, all of them will yet be brought present before Us."}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَايَةٌ","d":"waāyatun","e":"And a Sign"},{"c":"لَهُمُ","d":"lahumu","e":"for them"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"(is) the earth"},{"c":"الْمَيْتَةُ","d":"l-maytatu","e":"dead"},{"c":"أَحْيَيْنَاهَا","d":"aḥyaynāhā","e":"We give it life"},{"c":"وَأَخْرَجْنَا","d":"wa-akhrajnā","e":"and We bring forth"},{"c":"مِنْهَا","d":"min'hā","e":"from it"},{"c":"حَبًّا","d":"ḥabban","e":"grain"},{"c":"فَمِنْهُ","d":"famin'hu","e":"and from it"},{"c":"يَأْكُلُونَ","d":"yakulūna","e":"they eat"}],"a":{"g":"And a sign for them is the dead earth. We have brought it to life and brought forth from it grain, and from it they eat."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَعَلْنَا","d":"wajaʿalnā","e":"And We placed"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"gardens"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"نَخِيلٍ","d":"nakhīlin","e":"date-palms"},{"c":"وَأَعْنَابٍ","d":"wa-aʿnābin","e":"and grapevines"},{"c":"وَفَجَّرْنَا","d":"wafajjarnā","e":"and We caused to gush forth"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"in it"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْعُيُونِ","d":"l-ʿuyūni","e":"the springs"}],"a":{"g":"And We placed therein gardens of palm trees and grapevines and caused to burst forth therefrom some springs -"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"لِيَأْكُلُوا","d":"liyakulū","e":"That they may eat"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"ثَمَرِهِ","d":"thamarihi","e":"its fruit"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"عَمِلَتْهُ","d":"ʿamilathu","e":"made it"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"their hands"},{"c":"أَفَلَا","d":"afalā","e":"So will not"},{"c":"يَشْكُرُونَ","d":"yashkurūna","e":"they be grateful"}],"a":{"g":"That they may eat of His fruit. And their hands have not produced it, so will they not be grateful?"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"سُبْحَانَ","d":"sub'ḥāna","e":"Glory be"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(to) the One Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"created"},{"c":"الْأَزْوَاجَ","d":"l-azwāja","e":"(in) pairs"},{"c":"كُلَّهَا","d":"kullahā","e":"all"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"of what"},{"c":"تُنْبِتُ","d":"tunbitu","e":"grows"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَمِنْ","d":"wamin","e":"and of"},{"c":"أَنْفُسِهِمْ","d":"anfusihim","e":"themselves"},{"c":"وَمِمَّا","d":"wamimmā","e":"and of what"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُونَ","d":"yaʿlamūna","e":"they know"}],"a":{"g":"Exalted is He who created all pairs - from what the earth grows and from themselves and from that which they do not know."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَايَةٌ","d":"waāyatun","e":"And a Sign"},{"c":"لَهُمُ","d":"lahumu","e":"for them"},{"c":"اللَّيْلُ","d":"al-laylu","e":"(is) the night"},{"c":"نَسْلَخُ","d":"naslakhu","e":"We withdraw"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from it"},{"c":"النَّهَارَ","d":"l-nahāra","e":"the day"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"Then behold!"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"مُظْلِمُونَ","d":"muẓ'limūna","e":"(are) those in darkness"}],"a":{"g":"And a sign for them is the night. We remove from it [the light of] day, so they are [left] in darkness."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَالشَّمْسُ","d":"wal-shamsu","e":"And the sun"},{"c":"تَجْرِي","d":"tajrī","e":"runs"},{"c":"لِمُسْتَقَرٍّ","d":"limus'taqarrin","e":"to a term appointed"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"for it"},{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"تَقْدِيرُ","d":"taqdīru","e":"(is the) Decree"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزِ","d":"l-ʿazīzi","e":"(of) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمِ","d":"l-ʿalīmi","e":"the All-Knowing"}],"a":{"g":"And the sun runs [on course] toward its stopping point. That is the determination of the Exalted in Might, the Knowing."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْقَمَرَ","d":"wal-qamara","e":"And the moon"},{"c":"قَدَّرْنَاهُ","d":"qaddarnāhu","e":"We have ordained for it"},{"c":"مَنَازِلَ","d":"manāzila","e":"phases"},{"c":"حَتَّى","d":"ḥattā","e":"until"},{"c":"عَادَ","d":"ʿāda","e":"it returns"},{"c":"كَالْعُرْجُونِ","d":"kal-ʿur'jūni","e":"like the date stalk"},{"c":"الْقَدِيمِ","d":"l-qadīmi","e":"the old"}],"a":{"g":"And the moon - We have determined for it phases, until it returns [appearing] like the old date stalk."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"الشَّمْسُ","d":"l-shamsu","e":"the sun"},{"c":"يَنْبَغِي","d":"yanbaghī","e":"is permitted"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"for it"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"تُدْرِكَ","d":"tud'rika","e":"it overtakes"},{"c":"الْقَمَرَ","d":"l-qamara","e":"the moon"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"اللَّيْلُ","d":"al-laylu","e":"the night"},{"c":"سَابِقُ","d":"sābiqu","e":"(can) outstrip"},{"c":"النَّهَارِ","d":"l-nahāri","e":"the day"},{"c":"وَكُلٌّ","d":"wakullun","e":"but all"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"فَلَكٍ","d":"falakin","e":"an orbit"},{"c":"يَسْبَحُونَ","d":"yasbaḥūna","e":"they are floating"}],"a":{"g":"It is not allowable for the sun to reach the moon, nor does the night overtake the day, but each, in an orbit, is swimming."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَايَةٌ","d":"waāyatun","e":"And a Sign"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"أَنَّا","d":"annā","e":"(is) that"},{"c":"حَمَلْنَا","d":"ḥamalnā","e":"We carried"},{"c":"ذُرِّيَّتَهُمْ","d":"dhurriyyatahum","e":"their offspring"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْفُلْكِ","d":"l-ful'ki","e":"the ship"},{"c":"الْمَشْحُونِ","d":"l-mashḥūni","e":"laden"}],"a":{"g":"And a sign for them is that We carried their forefathers in a laden ship."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"وَخَلَقْنَا","d":"wakhalaqnā","e":"And We created"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مِثْلِهِ","d":"mith'lihi","e":"(the) likes of it"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَرْكَبُونَ","d":"yarkabūna","e":"they ride"}],"a":{"g":"And We created for them from the likes of it that which they ride."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"نَشَأْ","d":"nasha","e":"We will"},{"c":"نُغْرِقْهُمْ","d":"nugh'riq'hum","e":"We could drown them"},{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"then not"},{"c":"صَرِيخَ","d":"ṣarīkha","e":"(would be) a responder to a cry"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"they"},{"c":"يُنْقَذُونَ","d":"yunqadhūna","e":"would be saved"}],"a":{"g":"And if We should will, We could drown them; then no one responding to a cry would there be for them, nor would they be saved"}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"Except"},{"c":"رَحْمَةً","d":"raḥmatan","e":"(by) Mercy"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"from Us"},{"c":"وَمَتَاعًا","d":"wamatāʿan","e":"and provision"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"for"},{"c":"حِينٍ","d":"ḥīnin","e":"a time"}],"a":{"g":"Except as a mercy from Us and provision for a time."}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"قِيلَ","d":"qīla","e":"it is said"},{"c":"لَهُمُ","d":"lahumu","e":"to them"},{"c":"اتَّقُوا","d":"ittaqū","e":"Fear"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"بَيْنَ","d":"bayna","e":"(is) before you"},{"c":"أَيْدِيكُمْ","d":"aydīkum","e":"(is) before you"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"خَلْفَكُمْ","d":"khalfakum","e":"(is) behind you"},{"c":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","d":"laʿallakum","e":"so that you may"},{"c":"تُرْحَمُونَ","d":"tur'ḥamūna","e":"receive mercy"}],"a":{"g":"But when it is said to them, \"Beware of what is before you and what is behind you; perhaps you will receive mercy... \""}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"تَأْتِيهِمْ","d":"tatīhim","e":"comes to them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"ءَايَةٍ","d":"āyatin","e":"a Sign"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِ","d":"āyāti","e":"(the) Signs"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) their Lord"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they"},{"c":"عَنْهَا","d":"ʿanhā","e":"from it"},{"c":"مُعْرِضِينَ","d":"muʿ'riḍīna","e":"turn away"}],"a":{"g":"And no sign comes to them from the signs of their Lord except that they are from it turning away."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"قِيلَ","d":"qīla","e":"it is said"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"أَنْفِقُوا","d":"anfiqū","e":"Spend"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"from what"},{"c":"رَزَقَكُمُ","d":"razaqakumu","e":"(has) provided you"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"Said"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"كَفَرُوا","d":"kafarū","e":"disbelieved"},{"c":"لِلَّذِينَ","d":"lilladhīna","e":"to those who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believed"},{"c":"أَنُطْعِمُ","d":"anuṭ'ʿimu","e":"Should we feed"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"whom"},{"c":"لَوْ","d":"law","e":"if"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"Allah willed"},{"c":"اللَّهُ","d":"l-lahu","e":"Allah willed"},{"c":"أَطْعَمَهُ","d":"aṭʿamahu","e":"He would have fed him"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"(are) you"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"an error"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And when it is said to them, \"Spend from that which Allah has provided for you,\" those who disbelieve say to those who believe, \"Should we feed one whom, if Allah had willed, He would have fed? You are not but in clear error.\""}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَيَقُولُونَ","d":"wayaqūlūna","e":"And they say"},{"c":"مَتَى","d":"matā","e":"When (is)"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"this"},{"c":"الْوَعْدُ","d":"l-waʿdu","e":"promise"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you are"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"truthful"}],"a":{"g":"And they say, \"When is this promise, if you should be truthful?\""}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَنْظُرُونَ","d":"yanẓurūna","e":"they await"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"صَيْحَةً","d":"ṣayḥatan","e":"a shout"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةً","d":"wāḥidatan","e":"one"},{"c":"تَأْخُذُهُمْ","d":"takhudhuhum","e":"it will seize them"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"while they"},{"c":"يَخِصِّمُونَ","d":"yakhiṣṣimūna","e":"are disputing"}],"a":{"g":"They do not await except one blast which will seize them while they are disputing."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"Then not"},{"c":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","d":"yastaṭīʿūna","e":"they will be able"},{"c":"تَوْصِيَةً","d":"tawṣiyatan","e":"(to) make a will"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"أَهْلِهِمْ","d":"ahlihim","e":"their people"},{"c":"يَرْجِعُونَ","d":"yarjiʿūna","e":"they (can) return"}],"a":{"g":"And they will not be able [to give] any instruction, nor to their people can they return."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَنُفِخَ","d":"wanufikha","e":"And will be blown"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"[in]"},{"c":"الصُّورِ","d":"l-ṣūri","e":"the trumpet"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"and behold!"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْأَجْدَاثِ","d":"l-ajdāthi","e":"the graves"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"يَنْسِلُونَ","d":"yansilūna","e":"[they] will hasten"}],"a":{"g":"And the Horn will be blown; and at once from the graves to their Lord they will hasten."}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"قَالُوا","d":"qālū","e":"They [will] say"},{"c":"يَاوَيْلَنَا","d":"yāwaylanā","e":"O woe to us!"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Who"},{"c":"بَعَثَنَا","d":"baʿathanā","e":"has raised us"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"مَرْقَدِنَا","d":"marqadinā","e":"our sleeping place"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This (is)"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"وَعَدَ","d":"waʿada","e":"(had) promised"},{"c":"الرَّحْمَنُ","d":"l-raḥmānu","e":"the Most Gracious"},{"c":"وَصَدَقَ","d":"waṣadaqa","e":"and told (the) truth"},{"c":"الْمُرْسَلُونَ","d":"l-mur'salūna","e":"the Messengers"}],"a":{"g":"They will say, \"O woe to us! Who has raised us up from our sleeping place?\" [The reply will be], \"This is what the Most Merciful had promised, and the messengers told the truth.\""}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"كَانَتْ","d":"kānat","e":"it will be"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"صَيْحَةً","d":"ṣayḥatan","e":"a shout"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةً","d":"wāḥidatan","e":"single"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"so behold!"},{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"جَمِيعٌ","d":"jamīʿun","e":"all"},{"c":"لَدَيْنَا","d":"ladaynā","e":"before Us"},{"c":"مُحْضَرُونَ","d":"muḥ'ḍarūna","e":"(will be) brought"}],"a":{"g":"It will not be but one blast, and at once they are all brought present before Us."}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"فَالْيَوْمَ","d":"fal-yawma","e":"So this Day"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تُظْلَمُ","d":"tuẓ'lamu","e":"will be wronged"},{"c":"نَفْسٌ","d":"nafsun","e":"a soul"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"(in) anything"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"تُجْزَوْنَ","d":"tuj'zawna","e":"you will be recompensed"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(for) what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"So today no soul will be wronged at all, and you will not be recompensed except for what you used to do."}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"أَصْحَابَ","d":"aṣḥāba","e":"(the) companions"},{"c":"الْجَنَّةِ","d":"l-janati","e":"(of) Paradise"},{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"l-yawma","e":"this Day"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"[in]"},{"c":"شُغُلٍ","d":"shughulin","e":"will be occupied"},{"c":"فَاكِهُونَ","d":"fākihūna","e":"(in) amusement"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed the companions of Paradise, that Day, will be amused in [joyful] occupation -"}},"56":{"w":[{"c":"هُمْ","d":"hum","e":"They"},{"c":"وَأَزْوَاجُهُمْ","d":"wa-azwājuhum","e":"and their spouses"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"ظِلَالٍ","d":"ẓilālin","e":"shades"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"الْأَرَائِكِ","d":"l-arāiki","e":"[the] couches"},{"c":"مُتَّكِئُونَ","d":"muttakiūna","e":"reclining"}],"a":{"g":"They and their spouses - in shade, reclining on adorned couches."}},"57":{"w":[{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"For them"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"فَاكِهَةٌ","d":"fākihatun","e":"(are) fruits"},{"c":"وَلَهُمْ","d":"walahum","e":"and for them"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) whatever"},{"c":"يَدَّعُونَ","d":"yaddaʿūna","e":"they call for"}],"a":{"g":"For them therein is fruit, and for them is whatever they request [or wish]"}},"58":{"w":[{"c":"سَلَامٌ","d":"salāmun","e":"Peace"},{"c":"قَوْلًا","d":"qawlan","e":"A word"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبٍّ","d":"rabbin","e":"a Lord"},{"c":"رَحِيمٍ","d":"raḥīmin","e":"Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"[And] \"Peace,\" a word from a Merciful Lord."}},"59":{"w":[{"c":"وَامْتَازُوا","d":"wa-im'tāzū","e":"But stand apart"},{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"l-yawma","e":"this Day"},{"c":"أَيُّهَا","d":"ayyuhā","e":"O criminals"},{"c":"الْمُجْرِمُونَ","d":"l-muj'rimūna","e":"O criminals"}],"a":{"g":"[Then He will say], \"But stand apart today, you criminals."}},"60":{"w":[{"c":"أَلَمْ","d":"alam","e":"Did not"},{"c":"أَعْهَدْ","d":"aʿhad","e":"I enjoin"},{"c":"إِلَيْكُمْ","d":"ilaykum","e":"upon you"},{"c":"يَابَنِي","d":"yābanī","e":"O Children of Adam"},{"c":"ءَادَمَ","d":"ādama","e":"O Children of Adam"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"That"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(do) not"},{"c":"تَعْبُدُوا","d":"taʿbudū","e":"worship"},{"c":"الشَّيْطَانَ","d":"l-shayṭāna","e":"the Shaitaan"},{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"indeed, he"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"(is) for you"},{"c":"عَدُوٌّ","d":"ʿaduwwun","e":"an enemy"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Did I not enjoin upon you, O children of Adam, that you not worship Satan - [for] indeed, he is to you a clear enemy -"}},"61":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَنِ","d":"wa-ani","e":"And that"},{"c":"اعْبُدُونِي","d":"uʿ'budūnī","e":"you worship Me"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"صِرَاطٌ","d":"ṣirāṭun","e":"(is) a Path"},{"c":"مُسْتَقِيمٌ","d":"mus'taqīmun","e":"straight"}],"a":{"g":"And that you worship [only] Me? This is a straight path."}},"62":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"أَضَلَّ","d":"aḍalla","e":"he led astray"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"from you"},{"c":"جِبِلًّا","d":"jibillan","e":"a multitude"},{"c":"كَثِيرًا","d":"kathīran","e":"great"},{"c":"أَفَلَمْ","d":"afalam","e":"Then did not"},{"c":"تَكُونُوا","d":"takūnū","e":"you"},{"c":"تَعْقِلُونَ","d":"taʿqilūna","e":"use reason"}],"a":{"g":"And he had already led astray from among you much of creation, so did you not use reason?"}},"63":{"w":[{"c":"هَذِهِ","d":"hādhihi","e":"This (is)"},{"c":"جَهَنَّمُ","d":"jahannamu","e":"(the) Hell"},{"c":"الَّتِي","d":"allatī","e":"which"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you were"},{"c":"تُوعَدُونَ","d":"tūʿadūna","e":"promised"}],"a":{"g":"This is the Hellfire which you were promised."}},"64":{"w":[{"c":"اصْلَوْهَا","d":"iṣ'lawhā","e":"Burn therein"},{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"l-yawma","e":"this Day"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"because"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"تَكْفُرُونَ","d":"takfurūna","e":"disbelieve"}],"a":{"g":"[Enter to] burn therein today for what you used to deny.\""}},"65":{"w":[{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"al-yawma","e":"This Day"},{"c":"نَخْتِمُ","d":"nakhtimu","e":"We will seal"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"[on]"},{"c":"أَفْوَاهِهِمْ","d":"afwāhihim","e":"their mouths"},{"c":"وَتُكَلِّمُنَا","d":"watukallimunā","e":"and will speak to Us"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"their hands"},{"c":"وَتَشْهَدُ","d":"watashhadu","e":"and will bear witness"},{"c":"أَرْجُلُهُمْ","d":"arjuluhum","e":"their feet"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"about what"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they used (to)"},{"c":"يَكْسِبُونَ","d":"yaksibūna","e":"earn"}],"a":{"g":"That Day, We will seal over their mouths, and their hands will speak to Us, and their feet will testify about what they used to earn."}},"66":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"And if"},{"c":"نَشَاءُ","d":"nashāu","e":"We willed"},{"c":"لَطَمَسْنَا","d":"laṭamasnā","e":"We (would have) surely obliterated"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"[over]"},{"c":"أَعْيُنِهِمْ","d":"aʿyunihim","e":"their eyes"},{"c":"فَاسْتَبَقُوا","d":"fa-is'tabaqū","e":"then they (would) race"},{"c":"الصِّرَاطَ","d":"l-ṣirāṭa","e":"(to find) the path"},{"c":"فَأَنَّى","d":"fa-annā","e":"then how"},{"c":"يُبْصِرُونَ","d":"yub'ṣirūna","e":"(could) they see"}],"a":{"g":"And if We willed, We could have obliterated their eyes, and they would race to [find] the path, and how could they see?"}},"67":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"And if"},{"c":"نَشَاءُ","d":"nashāu","e":"We willed"},{"c":"لَمَسَخْنَاهُمْ","d":"lamasakhnāhum","e":"surely We (would have) transformed them"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"in"},{"c":"مَكَانَتِهِمْ","d":"makānatihim","e":"their places"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"then not"},{"c":"اسْتَطَاعُوا","d":"is'taṭāʿū","e":"they would have been able"},{"c":"مُضِيًّا","d":"muḍiyyan","e":"to proceed"},{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَرْجِعُونَ","d":"yarjiʿūna","e":"return"}],"a":{"g":"And if We willed, We could have deformed them, [paralyzing them] in their places so they would not be able to proceed, nor could they return."}},"68":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"And (he) whom"},{"c":"نُعَمِّرْهُ","d":"nuʿammir'hu","e":"We grant him long life"},{"c":"نُنَكِّسْهُ","d":"nunakkis'hu","e":"We reverse him"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْخَلْقِ","d":"l-khalqi","e":"the creation"},{"c":"أَفَلَا","d":"afalā","e":"Then will not"},{"c":"يَعْقِلُونَ","d":"yaʿqilūna","e":"they use intellect"}],"a":{"g":"And he to whom We grant long life We reverse in creation; so will they not understand?"}},"69":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"عَلَّمْنَاهُ","d":"ʿallamnāhu","e":"We taught him"},{"c":"الشِّعْرَ","d":"l-shiʿ'ra","e":"[the] poetry"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and not"},{"c":"يَنْبَغِي","d":"yanbaghī","e":"it is befitting"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"Not"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"(is) except"},{"c":"ذِكْرٌ","d":"dhik'run","e":"a Reminder"},{"c":"وَقُرْءَانٌ","d":"waqur'ānun","e":"and a Quran"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"And We did not give Prophet Muhammad, knowledge of poetry, nor is it befitting for him. It is not but a message and a clear Qur'an"}},"70":{"w":[{"c":"لِيُنْذِرَ","d":"liyundhira","e":"To warn"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"حَيًّا","d":"ḥayyan","e":"alive"},{"c":"وَيَحِقَّ","d":"wayaḥiqqa","e":"and may be proved true"},{"c":"الْقَوْلُ","d":"l-qawlu","e":"the Word"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"against"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"To warn whoever is alive and justify the word against the disbelievers."}},"71":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Do not"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they see"},{"c":"أَنَّا","d":"annā","e":"that We"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَا","d":"khalaqnā","e":"[We] created"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"مِمَّا","d":"mimmā","e":"from what"},{"c":"عَمِلَتْ","d":"ʿamilat","e":"have made"},{"c":"أَيْدِينَا","d":"aydīnā","e":"Our hands"},{"c":"أَنْعَامًا","d":"anʿāman","e":"cattle"},{"c":"فَهُمْ","d":"fahum","e":"then they"},{"c":"لَهَا","d":"lahā","e":"[for them]"},{"c":"مَالِكُونَ","d":"mālikūna","e":"(are the) owners"}],"a":{"g":"Do they not see that We have created for them from what Our hands have made, grazing livestock, and [then] they are their owners?"}},"72":{"w":[{"c":"وَذَلَّلْنَاهَا","d":"wadhallalnāhā","e":"And We have tamed them"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"فَمِنْهَا","d":"famin'hā","e":"so some of them"},{"c":"رَكُوبُهُمْ","d":"rakūbuhum","e":"they ride them"},{"c":"وَمِنْهَا","d":"wamin'hā","e":"and some of them"},{"c":"يَأْكُلُونَ","d":"yakulūna","e":"they eat"}],"a":{"g":"And We have tamed them for them, so some of them they ride, and some of them they eat."}},"73":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَهُمْ","d":"walahum","e":"And for them"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"مَنَافِعُ","d":"manāfiʿu","e":"(are) benefits"},{"c":"وَمَشَارِبُ","d":"wamashāribu","e":"and drinks"},{"c":"أَفَلَا","d":"afalā","e":"so (will) not"},{"c":"يَشْكُرُونَ","d":"yashkurūna","e":"they give thanks"}],"a":{"g":"And for them therein are [other] benefits and drinks, so will they not be grateful?"}},"74":{"w":[{"c":"وَاتَّخَذُوا","d":"wa-ittakhadhū","e":"But they have taken"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"besides"},{"c":"دُونِ","d":"dūni","e":"besides"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"ءَالِهَةً","d":"ālihatan","e":"gods"},{"c":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","d":"laʿallahum","e":"that they may"},{"c":"يُنْصَرُونَ","d":"yunṣarūna","e":"be helped"}],"a":{"g":"But they have taken besides Allah [false] deities that perhaps they would be helped."}},"75":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","d":"yastaṭīʿūna","e":"they are able"},{"c":"نَصْرَهُمْ","d":"naṣrahum","e":"to help them"},{"c":"وَهُمْ","d":"wahum","e":"but they"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"جُنْدٌ","d":"jundun","e":"(are) host(s)"},{"c":"مُحْضَرُونَ","d":"muḥ'ḍarūna","e":"(who will) be brought"}],"a":{"g":"They are not able to help them, and they [themselves] are for them soldiers in attendance."}},"76":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"So (let) not"},{"c":"يَحْزُنْكَ","d":"yaḥzunka","e":"grieve you"},{"c":"قَوْلُهُمْ","d":"qawluhum","e":"their speech"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"نَعْلَمُ","d":"naʿlamu","e":"[We] know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يُسِرُّونَ","d":"yusirrūna","e":"they conceal"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and what"},{"c":"يُعْلِنُونَ","d":"yuʿ'linūna","e":"they declare"}],"a":{"g":"So let not their speech grieve you. Indeed, We know what they conceal and what they declare."}},"77":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَمْ","d":"awalam","e":"Does not"},{"c":"يَرَ","d":"yara","e":"see"},{"c":"الْإِنْسَانُ","d":"l-insānu","e":"[the] man"},{"c":"أَنَّا","d":"annā","e":"that We"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاهُ","d":"khalaqnāhu","e":"[We] created him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"نُطْفَةٍ","d":"nuṭ'fatin","e":"a sperm-drop"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"Then behold!"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"خَصِيمٌ","d":"khaṣīmun","e":"(is) an opponent"},{"c":"مُبِينٌ","d":"mubīnun","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"Does man not consider that We created him from a [mere] sperm-drop - then at once he is a clear adversary?"}},"78":{"w":[{"c":"وَضَرَبَ","d":"waḍaraba","e":"And he sets forth"},{"c":"لَنَا","d":"lanā","e":"for Us"},{"c":"مَثَلًا","d":"mathalan","e":"an example"},{"c":"وَنَسِيَ","d":"wanasiya","e":"and forgets"},{"c":"خَلْقَهُ","d":"khalqahu","e":"his (own) creation"},{"c":"قَالَ","d":"qāla","e":"He says"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"Who"},{"c":"يُحْيِي","d":"yuḥ'yī","e":"will give life"},{"c":"الْعِظَامَ","d":"l-ʿiẓāma","e":"(to) the bones"},{"c":"وَهِيَ","d":"wahiya","e":"while they"},{"c":"رَمِيمٌ","d":"ramīmun","e":"(are) decomposed"}],"a":{"g":"And he presents for Us an example and forgets his [own] creation. He says, \"Who will give life to bones while they are disintegrated?\""}},"79":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"يُحْيِيهَا","d":"yuḥ'yīhā","e":"He will give them life"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"Who"},{"c":"أَنْشَأَهَا","d":"ansha-ahā","e":"produced them"},{"c":"أَوَّلَ","d":"awwala","e":"(the) first"},{"c":"مَرَّةٍ","d":"marratin","e":"time"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"بِكُلِّ","d":"bikulli","e":"(is) of every"},{"c":"خَلْقٍ","d":"khalqin","e":"creation"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"He will give them life who produced them the first time; and He is, of all creation, Knowing.\""}},"80":{"w":[{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"The One Who"},{"c":"جَعَلَ","d":"jaʿala","e":"made"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الشَّجَرِ","d":"l-shajari","e":"the tree"},{"c":"الْأَخْضَرِ","d":"l-akhḍari","e":"[the] green"},{"c":"نَارًا","d":"nāran","e":"fire"},{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"and behold!"},{"c":"أَنْتُمْ","d":"antum","e":"You"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from it"},{"c":"تُوقِدُونَ","d":"tūqidūna","e":"ignite"}],"a":{"g":"[It is] He who made for you from the green tree, fire, and then from it you ignite."}},"81":{"w":[{"c":"أَوَلَيْسَ","d":"awalaysa","e":"Is it not"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(He) Who"},{"c":"خَلَقَ","d":"khalaqa","e":"created"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَالْأَرْضَ","d":"wal-arḍa","e":"and the earth"},{"c":"بِقَادِرٍ","d":"biqādirin","e":"Able"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"to"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"[that]"},{"c":"يَخْلُقَ","d":"yakhluqa","e":"create"},{"c":"مِثْلَهُمْ","d":"mith'lahum","e":"(the) like of them"},{"c":"بَلَى","d":"balā","e":"Yes indeed!"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"الْخَلَّاقُ","d":"l-khalāqu","e":"(is) the Supreme Creator"},{"c":"الْعَلِيمُ","d":"l-ʿalīmu","e":"the All-Knower"}],"a":{"g":"Is not He who created the heavens and the earth Able to create the likes of them? Yes, [it is so]; and He is the Knowing Creator."}},"82":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّمَا","d":"innamā","e":"Only"},{"c":"أَمْرُهُ","d":"amruhu","e":"His Command"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"أَرَادَ","d":"arāda","e":"He intends"},{"c":"شَيْئًا","d":"shayan","e":"a thing"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"يَقُولَ","d":"yaqūla","e":"He says"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"to it"},{"c":"كُنْ","d":"kun","e":"Be"},{"c":"فَيَكُونُ","d":"fayakūnu","e":"and it is"}],"a":{"g":"His command is only when He intends a thing that He says to it, \"Be,\" and it is."}},"83":{"w":[{"c":"فَسُبْحَانَ","d":"fasub'ḥāna","e":"So glorified be"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(He) Who"},{"c":"بِيَدِهِ","d":"biyadihi","e":"in Whose hand"},{"c":"مَلَكُوتُ","d":"malakūtu","e":"is (the) dominion"},{"c":"كُلِّ","d":"kulli","e":"(of) all"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"things"},{"c":"وَإِلَيْهِ","d":"wa-ilayhi","e":"and to Him"},{"c":"تُرْجَعُونَ","d":"tur'jaʿūna","e":"you will be returned"}],"a":{"g":"So exalted is He in whose hand is the realm of all things, and to Him you will be returned."}}}